              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संदूक़ — sandūq — \"a trunk; a chest\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दादी के पुराने कपड़े एक संदूक़ में हैं। Dādī ke purāne kapṛe ek sandūq meṁ haiṁ. Grandmother's old clothes are in a trunk."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संदूक़ (sandūq) is usually traced to Arabic ṣandūq, \"a chest, a box\", through Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
